  predicting whether you will be at the keyboard in 5 minutes
  sampling every 30s, so the answer arrives 10 samples later
  sensors: idle time, machine, clock, weather (26.12, -80.14)
  it consolidates when it thinks you are AWAY, and that costs CPU it then sees
  starting a new life in live2_state

